&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;What Cognite is:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Relentless&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;to achieve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite operates at the forefront of &lt;strong&gt;industrial digitalization, building AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and data solutions that solve the world’s hardest, highest-impact problems. With unmatched industrial heritage and a comprehensive suite of AI capabilities, including low-code AI agents, Cognite accelerates the digital transformation to drive operational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We thrive in challenges. We challenge assumptions. We execute with speed and ownership. If you view obstacles as signals to step forward - not backwards - you’ll feel right at home here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Moonshot&lt;/a&gt; is bold: Unlock $100B in customer value by 2035, and redefine how global industry works. Join us in this venture where AI and data meet ingenuity, and together, we will forge the path to a smarter, more connected industrial future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; width=&quot;708&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Deployment Strategist, you are the owner of the customer&#39;s problem and the value we promise to deliver. You are the bridge between a customer&#39;s business objective and our technical delivery team, accountable for the &quot;why&quot; and the &quot;what&quot;, while Solution Architects and Data Engineers own the &quot;how&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with senior customer stakeholders to scope value, define pilots and releases, steer delivery through to go-live, and drive adoption so that value is actually realized after launch. You combine the discipline of a program manager with the product thinking of a field product owner, and you are as comfortable in a steering committee as you are in a working session with plant engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role. You are expected to shape the engagement, not just report on it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope and define value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Revenue to run discovery, map stakeholders, and translate business problems into a clearly scoped engagement (outcomes, MVP, success criteria, timeline, commercial boundaries).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build value cases and success metrics with the customer, and keep them visible throughout delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define what &quot;done&quot; and &quot;valuable&quot; mean for each release, and manage scope against them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own delivery outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead engagements end to end, from kickoff through go-live, using an iterative, continuous-delivery approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize the backlog with the customer and the delivery team, and make trade-off decisions on scope, timeline, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage risk, dependencies, and escalations across customer, partner, and internal teams, and unblock technical and political issues early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery health: plan, margin, forecast, resourcing needs, and status reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive adoption and value realization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the path from go-live to measurable usage: adoption plans, enablement and training, user feedback loops, and health indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify blockers to adoption and expansion signals early, and act on them with the account team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare a clean handoff to the long-term run and support model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with partners and the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate delivery with system integrator and partner teams, and protect clear accountability and contract boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide Solution Architects, Data Engineers, and Data Scientists in the engagement, and coach junior colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the Value Delivery playbook: lessons learned, reusable templates, and delivery standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feed the product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn field insight into structured product feedback for Product and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tooling in your own work (analysis, documentation, reporting, prototyping) and help the team raise its standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in customer-facing delivery, program management or technical advisory for enterprise software or data/AI platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of owning complex, ambiguous engagements through to measurable customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with technical subject matter (data platforms, integration, cloud, analytics, or AI/ML). You do not need to build the solution, but you must understand it well enough to scope it and challenge it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive-level communication: you can present, negotiate, and make decisions with senior customer stakeholders and with delivery engineers on the same day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of agile and iterative delivery, backlog prioritisation, and scope management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English and ideally French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel to customer sites up to 50%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in industrial sectors (energy, oil and gas, chemicals, pharma, manufacturing, utilities).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with value-based scoping (ROI/TCO) and authoring product requirements or solution specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in multi-vendor delivery models with system integrators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to industrial data, knowledge graphs, or operational technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a high-growth software company or a &quot;builder&quot; role in a startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn more about us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/resources/blog/key-highlights-from-impact-2025&quot;&gt;Impact 2025&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Cognite&#39;s Industrial AI: Moonshot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re globally recognized domain experts with an international presence that spans Phoenix, Houston, Oslo Tokyo, Bengaluru, and Abu Dhabi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cognite is committed to creating a diverse and inclusive environment at work and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive the same level of consideration for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title:&lt;/strong&gt; Product Manager - Device Data Management (Fluent French &amp;amp; English)&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris — Hybrid (3 days in office)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; €57,600 - €72,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Product Management - Data Device Management&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to: &lt;/strong&gt;Group Product Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in Paris, France and requires the successful candidate to be based in or willing to relocate to Paris. Fluent French and English (spoken and written) are essential for this position.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please submit your profile in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today&#39;s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future. Leveraging Data, AI, and real-time decision-making we turn energy complexity into growth opportunities for our partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable and affordable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead the French localisation of Device Data Management — one of the core product areas within the Kaluza platform that brings together data on supplies, meters, registers, reads and consumption. This area also covers the journeys around managing this data (like updating a meter&#39;s configuration), the APIs that expose it, the frontend pages that surface it to users, and the calculations behind consumption projection and forecasting. This is a hands-on, full-stack product role — you&#39;ll work across the whole product area, from the data model through to what users see on screen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;27:1-27:280;1959-2238&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate French market requirements into clear specifications&lt;/strong&gt; — turn the rules of the French energy market (including how device and meter data flows between grid operators and suppliers) into detailed product requirements covering compliance, data flows and data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;28:1-28:289;2239-2527&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build close working relationships&lt;/strong&gt; — work hand in hand with key partners in the French market to understand their needs, shape requirements together, and build the kind of trusted relationship where they come to you first, using that closeness to steer what we build next for France.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;29:1-29:286;2528-2813&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build, don&#39;t just specify.&lt;/strong&gt; Go from idea to working prototype yourself — query data, sketch API contracts, and stand up proofs of concept. We expect you to use AI tooling (e.g. Claude Code) as a daily multiplier to prototype, investigate, and unblock, not just to draft documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;30:1-30:327;2814-3140&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align global and local teams across all functions&lt;/strong&gt; — partner closely with engineering, UX, QA and more, with full-stack influence, keeping everyone pointed at the right outcomes. Be the go-to person for this product area in France, and act as the link between our global and local teams to inform priorities and strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideally you&#39;ll have/be:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven experience &lt;/strong&gt;as a Product Manager, Business Analyst, or&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;equivalent role in software companies, with a strong track record of successfully localising complex software products for international markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Previous experience in the French energy industry&lt;/strong&gt; — you know how the market works and its key players (e.g. Enedis / GRDF), especially around device data and market flows. Experience with energy management or utility platforms in the French market is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in French and very comfortable in English&lt;/strong&gt; — our platform and many of our teams operate in English, so you move easily between both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confident working directly with clients&lt;/strong&gt; — you can run a working session with client stakeholders, draw out the real requirement behind the ask, and keep senior people aligned and brought in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A builder&#39;s mentality&lt;/strong&gt; — resourceful and hands-on, comfortable building a working prototype rather than waiting for the perfect specification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technically comfortable&lt;/strong&gt; — at ease with data and data models, databases, and APIs, and able to prototype with modern AI tooling. You don&#39;t need to be an engineer, but you think like one and can hold your own in a technical conversation. Equally happy reasoning about a data model and about what the end user sees on screen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A clear, sharp communicator&lt;/strong&gt; — able to cut through noise and articulate technical and market complexity to a range of stakeholders, including clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience collaborating across cross-functional teams&lt;/strong&gt; — engineering, QA, BA, Programme, Delivery etc — to deliver localised solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proficiency in AI tools &lt;/strong&gt;throughout all stages of the product lifecycle — from discovery and ideation to delivery and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
