&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Europe Operations team is accountable for service delivery and eliminating supply blockers to meet demand, working closely with technical program managers, facility engineers, and site operations leaders dedicated to building and sustaining the world&#39;s most advanced autonomous fleet infrastructure. We&amp;nbsp; bridge physical engineering, power grid delivery, and software tooling to ensure Waymo&#39;s fleet operates safely, efficiently and continuously at global scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report to the &lt;strong&gt;Director of Operations, Head of Europe Operations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate European Site &amp;amp; Infrastructure Enablement: Lead the end-to-end multi-country program execution for new facility bring-up, high-voltage EV charging grid interconnections, and tech deployment across European hubs, ensuring infrastructure resilience and readiness for multi-market autonomous fleet operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Scalable Automation &amp;amp; Process Architecture: Standardize depot workflows across European facilities enabling scale &amp;amp; fleet growth, using continuous improvement principles, tracking mitigations, and removing blockers for scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complex Program Management: Establish and enforce a unified framework for rider-only operations, driving decisions to unlock all types of infra required to deliver service, including parking, charging, pit-stops, service centers and testing locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Vendor &amp;amp; Strategic Supplier Governance: Establish strategic new and existing partner frameworks and requirements across Europe to deliver high-performing SLA adherence, CapEx efficiencies, and continuous service delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build High-Impact Cross-Functional Alignment: Serve as the strategic bridge between Facilities, Engineering and Product leadership and local European field teams, aligning international program goals with technical roadmap requirements and regional operational realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize Multi-Country CapEx/OpEx Portfolios: Lead multi-million Euro infrastructure and technology budgets, establishing resource allocation models, cost-efficiency benchmarks, and financial governance to ensure European market expansion meets strategic financial targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience leading complex programs, technology operations, or infra-structure/industrial program management across multiple facilities, including multi-country European expansion in transportation or other operating fields/automated logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record as a senior technical, program management or strategy involving infrastructure, real estate bring-up, or large-scale technical operations across European regulatory jurisdictions (e.g., UK, Germany, Spain, France).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced expertise in data-driven operations management, using large sets of data to drive decision making, business intelligence, and advanced metrics to track multi-site throughput, charger utilization rates, and operational resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience developing and executing multi-facility Business Continuity Plans (BCP) and crisis recovery frameworks across high-demand critical facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Supply Chain, Business Operations, or equivalent practical experience (Master&#39;s/MBA or Six Sigma Black Belt preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and executive stakeholder management skills with proven ability to influence matrixed cross-functional teams and external regulatory/utility entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel within the EU up to 40% of the time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous Mobility &amp;amp; EV Infrastructure Domain Expertise: Deep familiarity with AV fleet operations, or ride-hailing support systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Border Regulatory Leadership: Hands-on experience navigating EU/UK transportation frameworks, municipal zoning, and high-voltage electrical grid interconnections with national utility providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International Program Scaling: Demonstrated success scaling operational footprints from initial pilot programs to multi-city commercial operations across diverse language and legal environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems Engineering &amp;amp; Automation Integration: Experience specifying, deploying, and validating programmatic software tools and automation systems inside physical depot environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in European Languages: Professional fluency in German, Spanish, French or other western European languages in addition to English is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lean/Six Sigma Certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level.&amp;nbsp; Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£118,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£124,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;41&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e43db32d6868&quot;&gt;As organizations rapidly adopt AI applications and agentic systems, security teams need visibility and control over how these technologies are being used. Datadog&#39;s AI &amp;amp; Data Security product helps customers discover, secure, and govern AI usage across their environments ensuring sensitive data is properly managed from model training through production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;398&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27c03b79d92a&quot;&gt;As a Product Manager II for AI &amp;amp; Data Security, you will own capabilities for AI discovery, posture management, and data security; giving customers complete visibility into their AI applications, agents, and enabling ecosystem, with prioritized actions to operate AI systems securely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;684&quot; data-local-id=&quot;44aee37ec729&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll partner with engineering, design, security research, and &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;GTM&lt;/span&gt; teams to define and ship platform capabilities that help organizations adopt AI at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;843&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8ddf43dbde22&quot;&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1094&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4c9e4fc0bcdf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c07a7426c8ba&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1112&quot; data-local-id=&quot;516711aa0752&quot;&gt;Own the roadmap for AI &amp;amp; Data Security capabilities, including AI and data discovery &amp;amp; posture management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1222&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0547ad38f712&quot;&gt;Define how security teams can assess and manage the security posture of AI-enabled systems, including configuration risks, sensitive data exposure, and policy violations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1396&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9c8df5783f61&quot;&gt;Work closely with engineers and designers to deliver new product capabilities end-to-end, from early concept through launch and iteration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1538&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6c236ef471d5&quot;&gt;Partner with Datadog security researchers to identify emerging risks in AI systems and translate them into actionable product features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1677&quot; data-local-id=&quot;98918a7daaee&quot;&gt;Engage with customers to understand how they are adopting AI and validate solutions that help them operate these systems securely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1811&quot; data-local-id=&quot;90a71da9fb0f&quot;&gt;Collaborate with go-to-market teams to enable adoption and communicate the value of AI security capabilities to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1937&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1656e90c63eb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fc5d1f9a70d8&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1952&quot; data-local-id=&quot;576727931839&quot;&gt;You have 3+ years of product management experience building technical products, ideally in security, AI, data, cloud infrastructure, or developer platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2112&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bf0d0c5030ae&quot;&gt;You have a strong understanding of generative AI, modern cloud environments and application architectures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2222&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bf178be840ba&quot;&gt;You are interested in the security challenges introduced by AI and machine learning systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2318&quot; data-local-id=&quot;05f27f5de4f0&quot;&gt;You enjoy working closely with engineers and are comfortable discussing technical implementation details and tradeoffs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2441&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1647f09501dd&quot;&gt;You regularly engage with customers and use their feedback to drive product decisions and prioritization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2550&quot; data-local-id=&quot;befd96352a06&quot;&gt;Experienced engaging customers and translating feedback into product decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2633&quot; data-local-id=&quot;510cd0d2a8f1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2866&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1a210977cd7d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4ef4bf57efa4&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2890&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f5aa6ed04382&quot;&gt;Generous and competitive benefits package&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2935&quot; data-local-id=&quot;22e32cbb6172&quot;&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3000&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f8d22f241ba9&quot;&gt;Continuous career development and pathing opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3059&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8b50929b1d11&quot;&gt;Employee-focused best in class onboarding&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3104&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b0257c43f425&quot;&gt;Internal mentor and cross-departmental buddy program&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3160&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dcce30279c90&quot;&gt;Friendly and inclusive workplace culture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
